      "text": "After years of sticking their nose where it doesn't belong, the noble has learned to read lips from afar. If they're trying to read lips in an encounter or attempting a difficult feat of lip reading, they are Fascinated and Off-Guard, and might need to succeed at a Society check check with a DC determined by the GM."
